{'symbol': 'ABBV', 'date': '2022-04-27 14:02:00', 'title': 'INVESTOR NOTIFICATION: KESSLER TOPAZ MELTZER & CHECK, LLP ANNOUNCES LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE ON JUNE 6, 2022 IN SECURITIES FRAUD CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT FILED AGAINST ABBVIE, INC.', 'text': 'RADNOR, PA. , APRIL 27, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE LAW FIRM OF KESSLER TOPAZ MELTZER & CHECK, LLP\xa0(WWW.KTMC.COM) INFORMS INVESTORS THAT THE FIRM HAS FILED A SECURITIES CLASS ACTION\xa0LAWSUIT AGAINST ABBVIE, INC. (ABBVIE) (NYSE: ABBV) ON BEHALF OF ALL PERSONS AND ENTITIES WHO PURCHASED OR OTHERWISE ACQUIRED ABBVIE SECURITIES BETWEEN APRIL 30, 2021, AND AUGUST 31, 2021, INCLUSIVE (THE "CLASS PERIOD").'}{'symbol': 'ABBV', 'date': '2022-04-27 05:45:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ALERT: THE GROSS LAW FIRM NOTIFIES SHAREHOLDERS OF ABBVIE INC. OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AND A LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE OF JUNE 6, 2022 - (NYSE: ABBV)', 'text': 'NEW YORK, APRIL 27, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE GROSS LAW FIRM ISSUES THE FOLLOWING NOTICE TO SHAREHOLDERS OF ABBVIE INC.. SHAREHOLDERS WHO PURCHASED SHARES OF ABBV DURING THE CLASS PERIOD LISTED ARE ENCOURAGED TO CONTACT THE FIRM REGARDING POSSIBLE LEAD PLAINTIFF APPOINTMENT.'}